[{"title":"至正妓人行","author":"李昌祺","text":"桃花含露伤春老，莲叶欺霜悴秋早。\n红飘翠殒谁可方？\n大都伎人白头媪。\n言辞婉媚虽足爱，颜色萎摧宁再好？\n姿同蒲柳先凋零，景近桑榆渐枯槁。\n我役房山滞客边，客边意气迥非前。\n螺杯谩想红楼饮，雁柱徒怀锦瑟弦。\n晏岁荒村因解后，芳尊小酌且留连。\n阳台楚雨情磨灭，舞袖弓鞋事弃捐。\n于今沦落依草木，天寒幽居在空谷。\n爷娘底处认坟墓，姊妹何乡寻骨肉。\n初谓终身永欢笑，那知末路翻捞摝。\n莫惜缥囊紫玉箫，暂吹绛阙瑶台曲。\n停觞起立态是痴，敛衽踌躇半饷时。\n凝情徘徊倾听久，微茫杳渺度腔迟。\n娇痴睍睆莺求友，嫩讶呢喃燕哺儿。\n巨壑潜蛟惊起蛰，危巢别鹄苦分离。\n分离或变成凄切，凄切愈加音愈咽。\n荡子江湖信息稀，疲兵关塞肌肤裂。\n似啼似诉复似泣，若慕若怨兼若诀。\n孤舟嫠妇旅魂消，异域累臣鬓毛折。\n参差角羽杂宫商，微韵纡馀巧抑扬。\n坠絮游丝争绕乱，哀蛩怨蚓互低昂。\n呦呦瑞鹿剔灵囿，哕哕和鸾集建章。\n楚弄数声谐洗簇，氐州一曲换伊凉。\n伊凉溜亮益闲暇，埙篪笛笙皆在下。\n琚瑀铿锵韵碧霄，机梭淅沥鸣玄夜。\n须臾众调多周遍，返席重论盛年话。\n一自干戈据扰攘，几多行辈遄沦谢。\n记得先朝至正初，奴家才学上头颅。\n银环约臂联条脱，彩线采绒缀罛罟。\n博局倦馀邀伴赌，秋千蹴罢倩人扶。\n纤腰数被邻姬妒，鬓发常烦阿姐梳。\n羽林英俊驰轻縠，惯向奴家通夕宿。\n凤枕鸾衾肯暂辜，蜂媒蝶使交相属。\n冰客反惧胭粉涴，香体匪藉沉檀浴。\n退居始替兴圣斑，内使传宣又催促。\n宇宙雍熙百姓安，仁覃四裔覆三韩。\n畏吾选作必阇赤，钦察恩深答刺罕。\n已见拂郎呈崿袅，还闻缅甸贡琅玕。\n丹楹陡峻栖蘖鹊，华表玲珑镂角端。\n神州形胜真佳丽，郁郁葱葱蟠王气。\n五谷丰登免税粮，九重娱乐耽声妓。\n广寒宵得侍乞巧，太液晨许陪修禊。\n避暑巡游欲届程，沿途宿顿争除地。\n随銮供奉拣娉婷，特敕奴家扈跸行。\n卤簿晓排仙仗发，抹伦晴鞠绣鞍乘。\n营间鼓镯轰雷动，碛外氛埃扫电清。\n纨扇试时违大内，花园过去是开平。\n宗王贵戚咸来会，崧呼万岁齐齐跪。\n绯缨帽妥钵焦圆，黑瓣髻纫卜郎锐。\n后先雉扇怯薛执，左右麟符火赤佩。\n茜罽缝袍竺国师，霞绡蹙帔天魔队。\n齐姜宋女总寻常，惟诧奴家压教坊。\n乐府竞歌新北令，构栏慵做旧《西厢》。\n煞寅院本编蒙赏，喝采箜篌每擅场。\n浑脱囊盛阿剌酒，达拿珠络只徐裳。\n胡元运祚俄然歇，远遁龙荒弃城阙。\n官里遥冲朔漠尘，哈敦暗哭穹庐月。\n坏宫昼静著封锁，虚室苔生罢朝谒。\n绝徼阴森部落衰，中原澒洞烽烟热。\n填沟塞堑总婵娟，蚁虱微躯幸瓦全。\n窈窕蛾眉浑懒画，蹒跚茧足亦羞缠。\n祇园披剃思依佛，梵榻跏趺儗学禅。\n练衲正宜参般若，赤绳无奈堕痴缘。\n兰心慧性非坚固，宛转绸缪媒妁误。\n嫁与凡庸里巷儿，流为鄙贱糟糠妇。\n文禽失类偶鸡鹜，孔雀迷群随鹘鹭。\n手具盘飧奉舅姑，亲操井硙应门户。\n物换星移十载强，尊嫜殂没藁砧亡。\n屡遭疾疫男捐馆，苦迫饥寒媳去房。\n瓦缶泥垆长是伴，瑶簪翠钿已相忘。\n忍谈富贵徒增感，怕说酸辛只断肠。\n筋骸疲惫龙钟久，里舍么娘嗤老丑。\n涂抹伊谁识阿婆，弹搊竞自矜纤手。\n偷生又幸逢明代，垂死宁当正丘首。\n轗轲颓龄谅弗多，槎牙瘦骨行将朽。\n欷歔叹古更嗟今，少日荣华晚陆沉。\n亹亹愿毋嫌䀨耳，寥寥罕遇是知音。\n织乌荏苒忙过隙，司马汍澜已湿衿。\n往运推移端莫挽，穷途汨没最难禁。\n妓人听我相宽慰，美貌多为姿质累。\n仓惶明镜乐昌分，缥缈层楼绿珠坠。\n虽云茕独困贫乏，嬴得娇娆到憔悴。\n世上浮名不直钱，杯中醇酎休辞醉。\n屏营抆泪起逶迤，载拜殷勤乞赋诗。\n土炕蓬窗愁寂夜，挑灯快读解愁颐。\n那知皓首逢元稹，弗用黄金铸牧之。\n洒翰酬渠增慷慨，风流千载系遐思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13307,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感寓 其四十八","author":"童轩","text":"老狐戴髑髅，夜拜北斗神。\n绥绥曳长尾，顷刻化为人。\n怪异固莫测，妖术方日新。\n高城窍深窟，蟠结无与伦。\n望之不能灌，忧愤填秋旻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13308,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池上夜坐","author":"童轩","text":"池上微雨收，凉月吐空谷。\n萧萧败垣柳，疏影覆我屋。\n草深蛤争鸣，荷折鹭惊宿。\n偶此遂闲情，居然忘宠辱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13309,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谪所有怀旧游诸友","author":"童轩","text":"忆昔论交日，相知尽少年。\n季良身任侠，叔度世称贤。\n夜雨弹棋局，春风放酒船。\n飘零各分手，愁绝越江边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13310,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆金陵 其一","author":"童轩","text":"金陵佳丽地，风景想依然。\n城阙金汤固，江山罨画连。\n晚风楼上笛，春水渡头船。\n惆怅曾游处，而今又几年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13311,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东林小隐卷为沈处士题 其一","author":"童轩","text":"小隐东林地，身闲岁月忘。\n曲池山倒影，虚阁水生凉。\n雨润琴丝慢，风薰药臼香。\n隐君清趣好，无梦到岩廊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13312,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和刘工部钦谟无题韵 其一","author":"童轩","text":"垂杨门巷嫩寒馀，银鸭香清绕燕居。\n妆镜窥红春有态，黛蛾分绿画难如。\n云飞巫峡频牵梦，潮隔浔阳久旷书。\n惆怅碧栏干外月，梨花疏影到窗虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13313,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和刘工部钦谟无题韵 其二","author":"童轩","text":"金殿萤流月半沈，谩思当日宠恩深。\n风清香箧捐秋扇，露冷空闺急暮砧。\n别院频翻鹅管玉，长门深锁兽环金。\n可怜碧海青天外，谁识姮娥夜夜心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13314,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和刘工部钦谟无题韵 其三","author":"童轩","text":"钿合鸾钗昨尚存，几看新水化生盆。\n金鱼户钥花千点，玉虎丝牵月一痕。\n斑竹暝烟思帝子，绿芜春雨怨王孙。\n愁来更上危楼望，江水悠悠也断魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13315,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和刘工部钦谟无题韵 其四","author":"童轩","text":"帘外东风扇晓寒，碧桃香老共谁看。\n金铃犬卧红绵毯，翠羽鹦啼白玉阑。\n花暗小机尘旧锦，草深回磴罢鸣銮。\n昼长寂寞无人问，自起闲敲响玉盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13316,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明书感","author":"童轩","text":"两年作县越江湄，回首乡关未得归。\n华发又惊佳节换，青云堪叹故交稀。\n山村细雨梨花发，茅屋东风燕子飞。\n潦倒不须嗟薄宦，且将樽酒送斜晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13317,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月十三日夜梦绣衣康用和握手话旧觉而闻雨有感诗以寄之","author":"童轩","text":"宦游岁月易蹉跎，青镜流光两鬓皤。\n客梦不知江水远，乡心偏傍雨声多。\n张衡有咏唯愁在，烛武无能奈老何。\n为问旧游骢马客，别来谁与共鸣珂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13318,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日 其三","author":"童轩","text":"萧萧木叶下高枝，又是深秋九日期。\n黄菊酒香人病后，白蘋风冷雁来时。\n参军帽落谁同调，宋玉诗成益自悲。\n有约不能逢一笑，看山窗下独支颐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13319,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉宫曲","author":"张楷","text":"日暮上帘钩，春风压翠楼。\n忽闻宣召急，罗帕掩箜篌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13320,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵怀古","author":"张楷","text":"落日沧江雨，东风废苑春。\n莫言三国士，犹胜六朝臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13321,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古词","author":"张楷","text":"罗帕凝香湿未乾，朱楼窗外雨生寒。\n灯花知是虚传喜，落尽青煤誓不看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13322,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫中词","author":"张楷","text":"宫中杨柳戏青娥，不见葳蕤舞凤过。\n怪底东风不相忘，隔墙吹送落花多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13323,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南春","author":"张楷","text":"满川啼鸟怨残红，水郭春园柳絮风。\n新雨一番江水阔，草痕将绿到吴中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13324,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"张楷","text":"青绫裙子试新裁，水面风吹拂拂开。\n舟小身轻波复静，荷花荡里去还来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13325,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园乐四首 其一","author":"张楷","text":"绿杨树头山近，碧草门前径斜。\n闭户不干俗虑，杖藜时到邻家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13326,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园乐四首 其二","author":"张楷","text":"孤棹斜阳水村，一犁暮雨平原。\n藤花靡靡落地，桑叶阴阴闭门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13327,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园乐四首 其三","author":"张楷","text":"清明处处飞雨，寒食家家禁烟。\n满地桑阴独步，半窗花影高眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13328,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园乐四首 其四","author":"张楷","text":"绕砌一湾流水，当门数个长松。\n烟中渔艇朝出，雨里人家夜春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13329,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读杨廉夫集","author":"聂大年","text":"文章五色凤之雏，酒借诗豪胆气粗。\n白发草《玄》扬子宅，红妆檀板谢家胡。\n金钩梦远天星坠，铁笛声寒海月孤。\n知尔有灵应不死，沧桑更变问麻姑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13330,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余读元人王仲蔚诗爱其杨柳青旗连坐榻杏花春色过邻墙之句惜无全章因足一律奉寄施彦颙","author":"聂大年","text":"夹城门外好风光，曾醉君家碧玉觞。\n杨柳青旗连坐榻，杏花春色过邻墙。\n回鸾锦字新题句，睡鸭铜炉小篆香。\n酩酊不辞归路晚，银鞍骢马映斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13331,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"锡山饮友人楼中临别赠以诗","author":"聂大年","text":"小楼烧烛了残棋，是我孤舟欲发时。\n千里宦情双鬓改，十年心事故人知。\n闲推甲子怜衰态，醉折名花续旧诗。\n无限西湖风月好，抱琴相访莫教迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13332,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏堤春晓","author":"聂大年","text":"树烟花雾绕堤沙，楼阁朦胧一半遮。\n三竺钟声催落月，六桥柳色带栖鸦。\n绿窗睡觉闻啼鸟，绮阁妆残唤卖花。\n遥望酒旗何处是，炊烟起处有人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13333,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘士亨","author":"聂大年","text":"一树樱桃鸟啄残，麦秋天气尚轻寒。\n蚕登曲箔桑初尽，燕补新巢土未干。\n囊里古方闲自检，镜中华发老羞看。\n花时不共刘郎醉，辜负东家芍药阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13334,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澄江舟中留别故旧","author":"聂大年","text":"雪后晴沙玉一坡，孤舟斜日奈愁何。\n白头宋玉偏能赋，红袖吴姬最善歌。\n笠泽溟烟连浦树，惠山寒翠湿渔蓑。\n伤心一带梁溪水，添得征人别泪多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13335,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画瓜","author":"聂大年","text":"翠实离离引蔓秋，西风凉露满林丘。\n东门尚有闲田地，千载无人说故侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13336,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉酬王司训云笺之贶二首 其一","author":"聂大年","text":"云笺新制出金溪，缄送烦君手自题。\n写得新词谁解唱，薛涛坟上草萋萋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13337,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉酬王司训云笺之贶二首 其二","author":"聂大年","text":"独倚东风有所思，霜纨小帖写唐诗。\n多情欲为秋娘赋，老却江南杜牧之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13338,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"聂大年","text":"缓鞚青骢踏软沙，画桥烟树酒旗斜。\n玉楼人醉东风晚，高卷红帘看杏花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13339,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题彦颙画中小景二首 其一","author":"聂大年","text":"水禽沙鸟自相呼，远近云山半有无。\n一叶扁舟两三客，载将烟雨过西湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13340,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题彦颙画中小景二首 其二","author":"聂大年","text":"雨余芳树净无尘，草色蒙茸浅带春。\n茅屋石田应尚远，夕阳愁杀独归人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13341,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日次侃禅师韵","author":"聂大年","text":"高亭暑夜景相和，凉月絺衣挂薜萝。\n杨柳风轻湖面阔，不知何处藕花多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13342,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春游图","author":"卞荣","text":"游丝百尺荡空阔，天上有人落白发。\n人生行乐及少年，《金缕》一声杯百罚。\n翩翩两骑出郭东，桃花如雨吹东风。\n愿倩游丝绊西日，不教便入咸池中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13343,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉兴留别诸友","author":"卞荣","text":"春波门外上春船，春涨葡萄绿浸天。\n共君细细酌篷底，西望落日横孤烟。\n倚篷横玉彻三弄，飞花谁遣回风送。\n须臾月出光满座，杯光滟滟金波动。\n美人相逢良不多，美景岂可成蹉跎。\n为欢未久又为别，空劳春梦落春波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13344,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠许德容","author":"卞荣","text":"少年赤手能缚虎，踏遍东华软红土。\n缠头百万轻买笑，挽弓两石漫好武。\n江南风月谁平分，拂衣归卧龙山云。\n姑苏台下为别墅，招要三友咏五君。\n金屏如花人去早，北里薰天迹如扫。\n平章不必唤张侯，来往风流成二老。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13345,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述怀效生肖体","author":"卞荣","text":"槐叶初生如鼠目，蜗牛绿树荫新绿。\n冯轩高吟坐虎皮，一扫顿令千兔秃。\n墨池之鱼曾化龙，三尺青蛇在袖中。\n失马休嗟塞上翁，忘羊歧路迷西东。\n沐猴而冠良足耻，五百斗鸡同梦死。\n狗监明当荐上林，牧猪江揖商丘子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13346,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"锦云轩为何挥使赋","author":"卞荣","text":"朝入锦云轩，莫作锦云梦。\n梦中满袖扑红香，艳妆醉压阑干重。\n酒杯如海和云吸，箫鼓声喧令行急。\n觉来但见胆瓶梅，冷风吹帘雪花湿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13347,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蕉萱仕女","author":"唐庠","text":"罗袜生香踏软沙，钗横玉燕鬓松鸦。\n春心正似芭蕉卷，羞见宜男并蒂花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13348,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小景","author":"唐庠","text":"落日青山凝紫烟，秋风残叶雁来天。\n五湖多少玻璃水，处处堪留载鹤船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13349,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏赠张伯仁陈邦器二才子","author":"唐广","text":"白下桥边杨柳枝，新黄嫩绿正当时。\n重来折入寻春手，不比樊川去较迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13350,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游雾山寺和冠莱公韵（集本不载）","author":"丘吉","text":"风引钟声落大溪，行厨酒尽夕阳低。\n斗杓斜坠阑干北，涧道横分略彴西。\n云杂天花银叶舞，门排行树宝幢齐。\n普香世界青山绕，一路烟霞送马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13351,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和姑苏刘工部昌无题三首 其一","author":"丘吉","text":"落花空怨五更风，江水无情日自东。\n只解诗中嘲阿软，宁知花里活秦宫。\n进来荔子枝犹绿，洗去胭脂井尚红。\n多少风流多少恨，玉笙吹断月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13352,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和姑苏刘工部昌无题三首 其二","author":"丘吉","text":"辘轳绠断玉瓶沉，双鲤无书碧海深。\n别梦吹残吴苑笛，愁肠敲断汉宫砧。\n病来眉淡波斯黛，老去屏闲孔雀金。\n不及浮云能自在，朝飞暮散却无心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13353,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和姑苏刘工部昌无题三首 其三","author":"丘吉","text":"《玉树》歌残谱不存，春泉空泻洗头盆。\n绛桃成子花无色，银烛烧心泪有痕。\n南国青春欺客鬓，东风芳草怨王孙。\n风流已逐红尘化，空有琵琶寄断魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13354,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日偶成","author":"丘吉","text":"江城开近白鸥沙，帘幕风凉秋满家。\n昨日邻姬新压酒，小槽一夜落莲花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13355,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"丘吉","text":"细语呼人远不闻，水光摇荡石榴裙。\n一身肌骨无多重，欲入荷花化彩云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13356,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜二首 其一","author":"丘吉","text":"银瓶浇茗漱春酲，倚遍雕阑睡未成。\n灯火谁家庭院里，樱桃花下尚吹笙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13357,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜二首 其二","author":"丘吉","text":"香尽铜炉火不增，一床寒被卧春冰。\n不知明月将人梦，去落红楼第几层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13358,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"因天如寄声沈启南","author":"丘吉","text":"日望江云卧草庐，烟波无处觅双鱼。\n高僧相见能传语，不写银笺小字书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13359,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄馆天宁寺二首 其一","author":"丘吉","text":"宝树林中避世情，琴囊长挂白云层。\n蒲团学得枯禅坐，合作东轩长老称。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13360,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄馆天宁寺二首 其二","author":"丘吉","text":"茶炉吹断鬓丝烟，借得禅林看鹤眠。\n不道秋风何处起，一堆黄叶寺门前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13361,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与唐惟勤索纸","author":"丘吉","text":"鱼网无功补蔡侯，蜀江不洗薛涛愁。\n教儿昨日翻诗稿，书破芭蕉数幅秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13362,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仕女","author":"丘吉","text":"丝抽霜藕织仙衣，立近芭蕉怨落晖。\n踏破绿苔罗袜冷，宫前昨夜有霜飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13363,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲午新岁九日腊尽","author":"周鼎","text":"荼垒明朝满市新，一杯灯下旧吟身。\n流年细检颁来历，往事都成扫去尘。\n薄有田庐聊卒岁，可无沟壑尚迟春。\n殷勤照取田蚕看，同是鸡豚社里人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13364,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夕阳","author":"周鼎","text":"白头人爱夕阳红，短葛凉生绿树风。\n别浦帆归天远近，乳鸦巢满屋西东。\n比邻酒熟闲招饮，故旧书来喜拆封。\n珍重曲阑干外月，又分清影照衰容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13365,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮南道中","author":"周鼎","text":"苇屋萧萧暗市尘，纵多花柳不成春。\n车声自绕东风展，不管天涯有远人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13366,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂兴三首 其一","author":"周鼎","text":"大字书便老眼，小弦声恼闲情。\n养得人来疏懒，枉教天与聪明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":13367,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]